==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Baron Face]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Face Baron is very slow, and so he won't be posing much of a problem at all. In truth, you only really need to spam [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] to beat the stage, as they can handle everything here.

